msgstr "Obrir la pestanya d’ajustaments «%s»"

msgid "Open Facebook Developers → Apps"
msgstr "Obrir Facebook Developers → Apps"

msgid "Open Google Cloud Credentials and create (or select) a project."
msgstr "Obriu Credencials de Google Cloud i creeu (o seleccioneu) un projecte."

